id: mochi-paste
section: Keyboard and text
item: Mochi: with the keyboard up over a page field, a hold on the field offers Paste in the card's sheet (the frame kept for the eye; the pasted text's landing is read by the page)
shells: mochi
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-input-echo.html
kit: cavekit-mochi-ui.md R2
calibrate echo
tap plain
expect keyboard up 8
sample page 100,100,668,420
hold-on plain 1500
wait differs 100,100,668,420 page 5
shoot mochi-field-sheet
chrome dialog-cancel
wait still 100,100,668,420 4
chrome kb-hide
expect keyboard down 8
